{"id":"658180","name":"咖喱肉沫盖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658180/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯牛奶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"前腿肉绞碎备用。","img":"images/658180/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱洗净切小丁。","img":"images/658180/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉沫。","img":"images/658180/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将肉沫炒散开炒干水份。","img":"images/658180/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量蚝油炒匀调味。","img":"images/658180/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入洋葱。","img":"images/658180/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒炒出香味。","img":"images/658180/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/658180/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入咖喱块。","img":"images/658180/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火煮开转小火炒十分钟左右。","img":"images/658180/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入少量纯牛奶炒匀即可。","img":"images/658180/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658180/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再来一碗饭，加上咖喱肉沫即可。","img":"images/658180/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658180/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658180/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}